{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several radio buttons and choose only one within the others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each radio button contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose the choosen value through this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISORadioPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a custom radio trait.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However if defined in the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPickerData"},{"text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Forbidden by design","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in both an error situation and a read only state.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioItem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" in both a read only and a disabled state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in radio buttons using MISORadioPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the MISORadioItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional withdefault values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [MISORadioPickerData<String>] {","        [","            MISORadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                        label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                        extraLabel: \"Very spicy\",","                                        description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                        image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","            MISORadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                        label: \"IPA beer\",","                                        description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                        image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","            MISORadioPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                        label: \"Mineral water\",","                                        image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: String = \"Choice_1\"","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical","    MISORadioPicker(selection: $selection, radios: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horitzontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the radio buttons are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    MISORadioPicker(selection: $selection,","                    radios: someDataToPopulate,","                    isReversed: true,","                    isReadOnly: true,","                    placement: .horitzontal(true))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.14.0","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Since"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoradiopicker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents15MISORadioPickerV","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"MISORadioPicker","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISORadioPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISORadioPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/init(selection:radios:placement:isOutlined:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPicker\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://MISOComponents/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"title":"SwiftUICore.View","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISORadioPicker/init(selection:radios:placement:isOutlined:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Defines the picker view which displays using ","type":"